  "gloss": "opening and closing (doors, windows)",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "opening and closing (of doors, windows, drawers)",
      "explanation": "The act of opening and closing something that has a door or lid: doors, windows, sliding screens, drawers, a refrigerator. Often used when talking about how gently, how often, or how noisily it is done."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "33205_akeshime_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦ドア→ドア：00773_doa⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{開|あ}け{閉|し}め⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦{静|しず}か→静か：00755_shizuka⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧。",
      "english": "Please open and close the door quietly.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "33205_akeshime_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{冷蔵庫|れいぞうこ}→冷蔵庫：01046_reizouko⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{何度|なんど}→何度：17592_nando⟧⟦も→も：00484_mo⟧{開|あ}け{閉|し}め⟦しないで→する：00392_suru⟧。",
      "english": "Don't keep opening and closing the fridge.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "33205_akeshime_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦この→この：00962_kono⟧⟦{古|ふる}い→古い：00488_furui⟧⟦{家|いえ}→家：00612_ie⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦{窓|まど}→窓：02254_mado⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{開|あ}け{閉|し}め⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧たび⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧ギシギシ⟦と→と：00512_to⟧⟦{音|おと}→音：00743_oto⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧。",
      "english": "In this old house the windows creak every time you open or close them.",
