  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦ドア→ドア：00773_doa⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{開|あ}け{閉|し}め: opening and closing the door\n- ⟦{窓|まど}→窓：02254_mado⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{開|あ}け{閉|し}め: opening and closing the windows\n- {開|あ}け{閉|し}め⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{楽|らく}→楽：02169_raku⟧だ: easy to open and close\n- ⟦{乱暴|らんぼう}→乱暴：02482_ranbou⟧な{開|あ}け{閉|し}め: slamming doors\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{開閉|かいへい}→開閉：06610_kaihei⟧: the same meaning in a technical or written register (signs on train doors, machinery)",
